1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,412
Agent ke Home tab mein ek indicator hai — Sync Health.

2
00:00:03,412 --> 00:00:04,866
Green matlab sab theek.

3
00:00:04,866 --> 00:00:08,847
Yellow matlab warning — jaise slow network ya large data queue.

4
00:00:08,847 --> 00:00:11,564
Red matlab problem — sync fail ho raha hai.

5
00:00:11,564 --> 00:00:16,178
Right side mein details bhi milte hain last sync time next scheduled sync

6
00:00:16,178 --> 00:00:17,884
aur pending vouchers count.

7
00:00:17,884 --> 00:00:23,003
Agar Sync Health kuch din se yellow hai, ek baar manual Sync Now button dabaaein.

8
00:00:23,003 --> 00:00:25,215
Usually issue resolve ho jaata hai.

9
00:00:25,215 --> 00:00:28,943
Red state mein, next video dekhiye — troubleshooting steps.
